e care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nFix engine crash when attempting to read an invalid `VkDebugUtilsObjectNameInfoEXT` struct\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThere's a bug in certain Qualcomm vulkan drivers that causes an invalid `VkDebugUtilsObjectNameInfoEXT` struct to be passed to the engine, causing a crash when attempting to read it.\r\nThis fix prevents attempting to read the struct when the `sType` does not match the expected one.\r\n\r\nNote that `VkDebugUtilsObjectNameInfoEXT.sType` is observed to be `0` instead of `VK_STRUCTURE_TYPE_DEBUG_UTILS_OBJECT_NAME_INFO_EXT` on Android XR, Pico, and HorizonOS.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/contribution_rules.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","description":"","color":"885544","default":false,"archived_at":nul